  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "DSH Superpowers Zh",
      "text": "[Superpowers-zh](https://github.com/jnMetaCode/superpowers-zh) core engineering skills packaged for [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-superpowers-zh\n```\n\nRestart the DSH Web service after installation. The bundle registers `brainstorming`, `writing-plans`, `executing-plans`, `systematic-debugging`, `test-driven-development`, `requesting-code-review`, `receiving-code-review`, and `verification-before-completion`."
    },
    {
      "section": "Scope",
      "text": "This is a thin DSH adapter. It ships only the eight listed upstream Markdown skills and does not include Pi-specific extensions, workflow runners, credentials, or local configuration."
    },
    {
      "section": "Attribution and license",
      "text": "The skills are copied from [jnMetaCode/superpowers-zh](https://github.com/jnMetaCode/superpowers-zh), licensed under MIT. `UPSTREAM-LICENSE` preserves the upstream license text. This adapter is also MIT licensed."
    }
